# CLI Reference

All CLI commands run in dojo. Use `!` syntax to run generators from any prompt:

## Reading mail

```
+mail-client!mail/inbox        Inbox messages (sorted by date, with unread count)
+mail-client!mail/sent         Sent messages
+mail-client!mail/read <@uv>   Full message by ID
+mail-client!mail/unread       Unread message count
+mail-client!mail/labels       All labels with counts
```

## Sending mail

**Note:** Comets cannot send messages, access gateways, register aliases, or run a gateway. Only planets, stars, and galaxies have full functionality.

To an Urbit ship (direct via Ames):

```
:mail-client &mail-action [%send [%urbit ~sampel-palnet] ~ ~ 'Subject' 'Body']
```

To an email address (via gateway):

```
:mail-client &mail-action [%send [%ext 'user@example.com'] ~ ~ 'Subject' 'Body']
```

With CC and BCC:

```
:mail-client &mail-action [%send [%urbit ~bus] ~[[%urbit ~zod]] ~[[%ext 'bcc@mail.com']] 'Subject' 'Body']
```

## Managing mail

```
:mail-client &mail-action [%mark-read 0v1.abc...]
:mail-client &mail-action [%mark-unread 0v1.abc...]
:mail-client &mail-action [%delete 0v1.abc...]
:mail-client &mail-action [%add-label 0v1.abc... %important]
:mail-client &mail-action [%remove-label 0v1.abc... %important]
```

## Gateway management

```
:mail-client &mail-action [%add-gateway ~mister-poster-midnev]
:mail-client &mail-action [%remove-gateway ~mister-poster-midnev]
:mail-client &mail-action [%set-gateway ~mister-poster-midnev]
```

## Debug

```
:mail-client +dbug [%state '']
```

## Scry endpoints

```
.^(inbox %gx /=mail-client=/inbox/noun)
.^(sent %gx /=mail-client=/sent/noun)
.^(@ud %gx /=mail-client=/unread-count/noun)
.^((unit @p) %gx /=mail-client=/gateway/noun)
```
